# SokoYetu Stage 20 Deployment Checklist

## Before GitHub

- [ ] .env is in .gitignore.
- [ ] node_modules is in .gitignore.
- [ ] dev.db is in .gitignore.
- [ ] uploads/products is in .gitignore.
- [ ] package-lock.json is present.
- [ ] Prisma migrations are present.
- [ ] Real secrets are not committed.

## Render

- [ ] PostgreSQL database created.
- [ ] Web service created.
- [ ] Build command set.
- [ ] Start command set.
- [ ] Health check path set to /api/health.
- [ ] Environment variables added.
- [ ] First deployment succeeds.
- [ ] /api/health works.
- [ ] /api/products works.

## Secrets

- [ ] JWT_SECRET is long and new.
- [ ] Daraja credentials are regenerated if previously exposed.
- [ ] Cloudinary secret is private.
- [ ] LiveKit secret is private.
- [ ] ADMIN_REGISTRATION_ENABLED=false.

## Functional testing

- [ ] Buyer account works.
- [ ] Seller account works.
- [ ] Admin account works.
- [ ] Cloudinary upload works.
- [ ] Daraja STK works.
- [ ] Daraja callback updates payment/order.
- [ ] LiveKit seller room works.
- [ ] Buyer can join live room.
- [ ] Admin AI Suite works.
- [ ] Wholesaler import works.

## Not yet public go-live

Stage 20 deploys the app, but public commercial launch should wait until:

- [ ] Legal pages are reviewed.
- [ ] Real business M-PESA credentials are ready.
- [ ] Domain is connected.
- [ ] Business email is connected.
- [ ] Test accounts are replaced or secured.
- [ ] Backups and monitoring are configured.
